1
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:42,000
Mankind's Deadliest Threat Will Not Come From The Skies.

2
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,000
Night Shadows is a horror, science fiction, thriller
film directed by John "Bud" Cardos.

3
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:54,000
When two brothers, Josh and Mike, go to a small southern town for a
vacation, they find most of the residents either dead or missing.

4
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:30,000
When Mike himself goes missing, Josh teams up with the local sheriff and an attractive school teacher to find him until Josh discovers that the whole town and most of
it's people have been infected by a form of toxic waste, and they have all turned into toxic vampires whom prowl the streets at night for human blood!

5
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:06,000
Josh Cameron, played by Wings Hauser.

6
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:42,000
Sheriff Will Stewart, played by Bo Hopkins.

7
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:18,000
Holly Pierce, played by Jody Medford.

8
00:52:48,000 --> 00:52:54,000
Mike Cameron, played by Lee Montgomery.

9
00:59:24,000 --> 00:59:30,000
Albert Hogue, played by Marc Clement.

10
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Billy, played by Cary Guffey.

11
01:12:36,000 --> 01:12:42,000
Mutant is a 1984 American horror film.

12
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:18,000
It was initially released to theaters as Night Shadows, but it premiered on video with
the Mutant title, which it has retained for all subsequent releases.

13
01:25:48,000 --> 01:25:54,000
The film explores themes of sheriff, motel, toxic, zombie.

14
01:32:24,000 --> 01:32:30,000
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and intense.
